# `no-transform` on these revalidated responses stops Cloudflare from
# injecting its JavaScript Detections script (a challenge-platform inline
# <script>), which the zone's strict script-src would block for lack of
# 'unsafe-inline'. It is free-tier and cannot be disabled in the dashboard, so
# each response opts out. Everything but the hashed build assets must
# revalidate so that deploys, including service-worker updates, propagate
# immediately.
# Content-Security-Policy is set by the zone's response-header ruleset so it
# stays identical across every site.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-transform
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Hashed Vite build assets are immutable. Header values merge across matching
# rules, so the detach removes the rule above before this one applies.
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
